    "aspect_ratio": 1.778,
    "framing": "close",
    "notes": "Over the shoulder (no insert: camera.gags.no_repeat shop). Lens above his right shoulder at (3.62, 8.90, 1.28): 5 cm in front of the back-wall face, east of the display stand's top tier, about 0.39 m from the kneel-rig phone (3.45, 8.88, 0.93); the builder aims once at the phone at f0 (tilt down about 64 deg, computed). No wild piece. FACT (draft frames f0/f6/f14/f20/f26/f32, bpy 5.0.1, 2026-10-02): the rig turns the screen toward his face, so f4-f22, while he leans to the stand, the phone stands upright facing this lens with the status bar at the top; the bolt appears at f14 beside the red 3 % and stays in frame to f35; from about f24 his head is back over the phone, the phone lies flat and the status bar (bolt, 3 %, battery) reads sideways at frame right under his hair. His right arm crosses frame left to the stand f6-f16. Bolt size: about 1.5 % of frame height (4.8 mm glyph, 225 mm frame at the phone), under the 3 % of camera.inserts.legibility: see rationale.camera.",
    "subject_position": "phone_centre"
